---
// /second-opinion — the $497 paid entry offer. Copy approved in
// Dropbox/EngageEngine/Client Reports/Marketing Performance/Second Opinion — Offer Page Copy 2026-10-09.md
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro'
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro'
import CaseStudyCards from '../../components/CaseStudyCards.astro'

// Paste the Stripe Payment Link here. Until then the buy buttons call the office.
// Stripe Payment Link → After payment → redirect to https://marketingperformance.net/second-opinion/thanks/
const STRIPE_URL = ''
const PHONE = '803-386-8337'
const TEL = 'tel:+18033868337'
const buyHref = STRIPE_URL || TEL

const caseStudies = [
  { client: 'The Guttermen', headline: 'Twice the estimate bookings. Within 45 days.',
    summary: 'Advertising, intent-based email follow-up, and a connected website and inquiry system supported a doubling of estimate bookings within the first 45 days of working together.',
    href: '/case-studies/the-guttermen/' },
  { client: 'Punch List Pros', headline: '$5.20 in booked work per Google Ads dollar.',
    summary: 'August 2026 reporting connected Google advertising to uploaded closed-job values. Alongside search, the Meta program generated 97 lead-form submissions at approximately $29 each over the April–September reporting window.',
    href: '/case-studies/punch-list-pros/' },
  { client: 'Midlands Landscape', headline: '20% growth. In a market that grew 6%.',
    summary: 'A coordinated marketing program connected intent-based audiences, advertising, and email follow-up across landscaping, hardscaping, and landscape supply.',
    href: '/case-studies/midlands-landscape/' },
];
---
<Base
  title="Second Opinion — Marketing Performance"
  description="In three days we show you where your market is choosing someone else, with proof you can check yourself. $497, credited if you hire us.">

  <nav class="mp-nav">
    <div class="mp-nav-inner">
      <a href="/" class="mp-logo">
        <img src="/mp-logo-v3.png" alt="Marketing Performance — Powered by EngageEngine™" width="217" height="44" />
      </a>
      <a href={TEL} class="mp-nav-phone" data-track="call">{PHONE}</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <main class="so">

    <header class="so-hero">
      <p class="so-eye">Marketing Performance · Powered by EngageEngine™</p>
      <h1>You already have the demand. You're losing it before they hire you.</h1>
      <p class="so-lead">Some customers never found you. Some found you and called someone else. Some got your quote and went quiet. Some said yes and never booked. In three days we'll show you which ones, and why.</p>
      <div class="so-buy">
        <a href={buyHref} class="so-btn" data-track="buy" data-pos="hero">Get the Second Opinion. $497</a>
        <p class="so-under">Or call. <a href={TEL} data-track="call">{PHONE}</a>. I answer.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <article class="so-doc">

      <section>
        <h2>You've been offered a free audit before.</h2>
        <p>Probably this month.</p>
        <p>You know what a free audit is. It's a sales call with a PDF stapled to it. Somebody runs your website through a tool, finds twelve things wrong, and every one of them happens to be something they sell.</p>
        <p>This isn't that. Nothing in this report is a reason to hire us. It's a list of where your market is choosing someone else right now, with proof you can check yourself in about thirty seconds.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>We don't look at your marketing. We look at your market.</h2>
        <ol class="so-list">
          <li>
            <h3>Who shows up instead of you.</h3>
            <p>We search your service in your town the way a customer does. Google. The map. And now ChatGPT. We screenshot who gets named. If it isn't you, you'll see exactly who it is.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Why customers pick the other guy.</h3>
            <p>We read what your customers say about you. Then we read what your competitors' customers say about them. In their words, not ours. Every market has three or four reasons people choose. You'll know which ones you're losing on.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>Whether anyone answers at 7pm.</h3>
            <p>We call. We fill out your quote form and time the reply. Then we do the same thing to your top three competitors. You'll see the stopwatch.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>What it's worth to you.</h3>
            <p>You give us three numbers. Your average job. How many quotes you send a month. How many you book. We'll show you what the gap is costing you. We'd rather be low and right.</p>
          </li>
          <li>
            <h3>The three things to fix this week.</h3>
            <p>Not twelve. Three. In order. With the tool for each one, already built.</p>
          </li>
        </ol>
        <p>Then we get on the phone for thirty minutes and walk through it. That's the part people tell us was worth the money.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>Who it's for</h2>
        <p>Any business that lives on local customers. A roofer. A plastic surgeon. A law firm. A gutter company. A preschool. The names on the report change. The four places a sale breaks don't.</p>
        <p>Doing less than $500,000 a year? <a href="/diagnostic/">Take the free diagnostic instead.</a> It gets you most of the way there and it costs nothing.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="so-price">
        <h2>What it costs</h2>
        <p class="so-amount">$497</p>
        <p>Hire us inside 30 days and it comes off your first invoice.</p>
        <p>Not ready to hire anyone? Keep the report. Fix the three things yourself. We'll have told you how.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>You decide if it was worth it.</h2>
        <p>If it doesn't show you one thing you didn't know, and can check yourself, we refund the $497. You keep the report. You don't have to argue with us about it.</p>
      </section>

      <section>
        <h2>One more thing.</h2>
        <p>We never work with your competitors. One company per trade, per town. If we already work for someone in your trade in your market, we tell you before you pay.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="so-letter">
        <h2>From Robbie</h2>
        <p>I've been in advertising 41 years. I've owned this company for 31 of them. In all that time I never saw a free audit that wasn't a sales pitch, including the ones we used to give. So we quit.</p>
        <p>What we do instead is charge you a little, tell you the truth, and let you decide. Most people who buy this don't hire us. That's fine. Three fixed problems is three fixed problems. The ones who do hire us already know what we found, so we skip the pitch and go to work.</p>
        <p>Does that help? Call me and ask anything. <a href={TEL} data-track="call">{PHONE}</a>.</p>
        <p class="so-sig">Robbie</p>
      </section>

    </article>

    <section class="so-proof">
      <h2>What happened for people who did hire us</h2>
    </section>
    <CaseStudyCards cards={caseStudies} />

    <section class="so-close">
      <div class="so-close-inner">
        <h2>Already took the free diagnostic?</h2>
        <p>That told you where you think you're losing jobs. This checks it from the outside, against the people actually taking them.</p>
        <a href={buyHref} class="so-btn" data-track="buy" data-pos="close">Get the Second Opinion. $497</a>
        <p class="so-under">Three days. Report, screenshots, call. <a href={TEL} data-track="call">{PHONE}</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <Footer ctaHref="/diagnostic/" />
</Base>

<script is:inline>
  // One measured action per click. "buy" = checkout started; the sale itself fires on /second-opinion/thanks/.
  document.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
    var a = e.target.closest && e.target.closest('[data-track]');
    if (!a) return;
    var kind = a.getAttribute('data-track');
    if (kind === 'buy') {
      if (typeof gtag === 'function') gtag('event', 'begin_checkout', { value: 497, currency: 'USD', items: [{ item_name: 'Second Opinion' }], position: a.getAttribute('data-pos') || '' });
      if (typeof fbq === 'function') fbq('track', 'InitiateCheckout', { value: 497, currency: 'USD', content_name: 'Second Opinion' });
    } else if (kind === 'call') {
      if (typeof gtag === 'function') gtag('event', 'phone_click', { page: 'second-opinion' });
      if (typeof fbq === 'function') fbq('track', 'Contact', { content_name: 'Second Opinion' });
    }
  });
</script>

<style>
  .mp-nav {
    position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,0.72);
    backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: saturate(180%) blur(20px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .mp-nav-inner {
    max-width: 1280px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 32px; height: 56px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px;
  }
  .mp-logo { display: flex; align-items: center; min-height: 44px; text-decoration: none; }
  .mp-logo img { height: 44px; width: auto; display: block; }
  .mp-nav-phone {
    font-family: var(--font-t); font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--graphite); text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .mp-nav-phone:hover { color: var(--blue-link); }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .mp-nav-inner { padding: 0 20px; }
    .mp-logo img { height: 34px; }
  }

  .so { background: var(--canvas); }

  .so-hero { max-width: 820px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 88px 24px 64px; text-align: left; }
  .so-eye {
    font-family: var(--font-t); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--mid-gray); margin-bottom: 18px;
  }
  .so-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-d); font-size: clamp(38px, 6vw, 64px); font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--graphite);
    margin-bottom: 24px; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .so-lead {
    font-family: var(--font-t); font-size: clamp(19px, 2.2vw, 22px); line-height: 1.5;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: var(--deep-gray); max-width: 680px; margin-bottom: 34px;
  }
  .so-buy { display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; }
  .so-under { font-family: var(--font-t); font-size: 15px; color: var(--mid-gray); letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
  .so-under a { color: var(--graphite); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; white-space: nowrap; }
  .so-under a:hover { color: var(--blue-link); }

  .so-btn {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    background: var(--blue); color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-t); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.022em;
    padding: 15px 28px; border-radius: var(--r-btn); text-decoration: none; line-height: 1.2;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .so-btn:hover { background: var(--blue-link); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; }
  .so-btn::after { content: "→"; transition: transform 0.2s; }
  .so-btn:hover::after { transform: translateX(3px); }
  .so-btn:focus-visible, .so-doc a:focus-visible, .mp-nav-phone:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--blue); outline-offset: 3px; }

  .so-doc {
    max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 72px; background: var(--white);
    padding: 64px 56px; border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .so-hero { padding: 56px 20px 44px; }
    .so-doc { padding: 40px 22px; margin: 0 12px 56px; }
  }
  .so-doc section + section { margin-top: 52px; padding-top: 44px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .so-doc h2, .so-proof h2, .so-close h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-d); font-size: clamp(26px, 3.4vw, 32px); font-weight: 600;
    line-height: 1.15; letter-spacing: -0.022em; color: var(--graphite);
    margin-bottom: 18px; text-wrap: balance;
  }
  .so-doc p {
    font-family: var(--font-t); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em; color: var(--graphite); margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .so-doc p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .so-doc a { color: var(--blue-link); text-decoration: none; }
  .so-doc a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

  .so-list { list-style: none; counter-reset: so; margin: 8px 0 28px; padding: 0; display: grid; gap: 26px; }
  .so-list li { counter-increment: so; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 40px 1fr; column-gap: 14px; }
  .so-list li::before {
    content: counter(so); grid-row: span 2;
    font-family: var(--font-d); font-size: 28px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1;
    color: var(--light-gray); letter-spacing: -0.02em; padding-top: 2px;
  }
  .so-list h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-d); font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em; color: var(--graphite); margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .so-list p { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .so-amount {
    font-family: var(--font-d) !important; font-size: clamp(56px, 9vw, 80px) !important;
    font-weight: 600; line-height: 1 !important; letter-spacing: -0.04em !important;
    margin: 4px 0 20px !important;
  }

  .so-letter p { font-size: 19px; }
  .so-sig { font-family: var(--font-d) !important; font-size: 22px !important; font-weight: 600; margin-top: 8px; }

  .so-proof { max-width: 1160px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 24px 32px 12px; }
  .so-proof h2 { margin-bottom: 0; }

  .so-close {
    background: #1d1d1f; color: #fff; text-align: left;
    padding: 80px 24px 88px; margin-top: 40px;
  }
  .so-close-inner { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; }
  .so-close h2 { color: #fff; }
  .so-close p {
    font-family: var(--font-t); font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.55; letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.74); margin-bottom: 28px;
  }
  .so-close .so-under { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.6); margin-top: 14px; margin-bottom: 0; }
  .so-close .so-under a { color: #fff; }
</style>
